[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5390534881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122732#issuecomment-5390534881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122732","id":5390534881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQU0I4Q","user":{"login":"celyk","id":50609684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNjA5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50609684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk","html_url":"https://github.com/celyk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T03:57:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T03:57:33Z","body":"I'm not 100% on what screen_get_dpi() is intended to be, whether it's logical DPI or physical DPI. It was just easy to assume logical DPI was intended because thats what it returns on Android. Either way here's an easier formula:\n`logical DPI  = physical DPI * UI Scale`\n\nMaking screen_get_dpi() physical DPI seems more straightforward? Just gotta make sure the formula holds when using screen_get_scale() as UI scale. That would resolve this issue for macOS, but not Android.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5390534881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5398795203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122732#issuecomment-5398795203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122732","id":5398795203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQcsTww","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T17:20:21Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T17:22:03Z","body":"> I'm not 100% on what screen_get_dpi() is intended to be, whether it's logical DPI or physical DPI. \n\nThe Windows implementation returns logical DPI, while Linux/X11 returns physical DPI. I noticed this while implementing https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122069 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122109.\n\nUnfortunately, it's inconsistent across platforms, and fixing this will break compatibility with existing projects that rely on the current values. To preserve compatibility, we should probably introduce two methods (one for physical DPI, one for logical DPI) and keep the current method as deprecated.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5398795203/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5399633371","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122732#issuecomment-5399633371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122732","id":5399633371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQdfd2w","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T18:33:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T18:33:04Z","body":"+1 to @Calinou comment. \n\n@celyk I don't think the assumption you're making hold with the current (platform-specific) implementation of the `screen_get_dpi()` and `screen_get_scale()`. \nAs such, this shouldn't be an issue, but rather a proposal for new APIs that hold the stated assumption.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5399633371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5400043818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122732#issuecomment-5400043818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122732","id":5400043818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQd4hKg","user":{"login":"celyk","id":50609684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNjA5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50609684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk","html_url":"https://github.com/celyk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T19:10:21Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T01:27:24Z","body":"On Android screen_get_scale() looks wrong to me either way. But some kind of proposal is a good idea. I have more to say soon. Thank you guys for taking a look.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5400043818/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5400280460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122732#issuecomment-5400280460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122732","id":5400280460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQeG9jA","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T19:31:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T19:31:36Z","body":"> On Android screen_get_scale() looks wrong to me no matter how you spin it. \n\nA `spin` implies the intent to be deceitful, or hide some wrongdoings. This may not have been what you meant but it can be perceived as such, especially when communicating via text. We could argue ad-nauseam whether these functions are right or wrong, but the reality is that we cannot change them without breaking existing projects that rely on their current behavior.\n\n> But some kind of proposal is a good idea. I have more to say soon. Thank you guys for taking a look.\n\nSo we'll be more productive designing alternative APIs and to that end I'm looking forward to your proposal!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5400280460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5403815564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122732#issuecomment-5403815564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122732","id":5403815564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQheujA","user":{"login":"celyk","id":50609684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNjA5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50609684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk","html_url":"https://github.com/celyk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T01:28:34Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T01:28:34Z","body":"I see what you're saying and even though it was not my intent, I'm sorry. I have edited my comment, I hope this helps.\n\nRegarding my proposal, I have a clear vision for how it ought to be. This issue will make more sense with the whole picture in place.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5403815564/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,